  "scope": "24 fresh sequential ordinary processes, three alternating pairs for four workloads. Four seconds of verified cyclic1KiB values/window16, 8192 idle rooms. Worker/CPU set and active pairs/fanout readers recorded per cohort. Every sender/body/FIFO, Close/EOF and exact counter/resource check is mandatory. No profiler, compilation or other load test overlaps timing. Server CPU per output is the per-run ratio over all timed verified deliveries. Finite plaintext loopback measurements, not saturated capacity or a language comparison.",
